    "media:imagetext": "ABOARD TWA FLIGHT\nPOSITION AT_\n9:37\n12\nAM\nPM MST\nPassenger Flight Record\nPLEASE PASS THIS REPORT TO ANOTHER PASSENGER\nTO ALL PASSENBERS\nPASSENGER'S NAME\n_DATE.\nSEPT. 26,1949\nWEAS\nFRESCOTT, ARIZONA\nWILL BE\nALTITUDE ABOVE SEA LEVEL / 2,000 FT.\nCABIN ALTITUDE\nABOVE THE GROUND\n6600\nFT\nFT.\nWE HAVE A\nTAILWIND OF\nLO M.P.H. GIVING US A GROUND SPEED OF 870 M.P.H.\n• HEADWIND OF -\nTEMPERATURE OUTSIDE THE CABIN IS_\n30 €\nARRIVAL AT KANSAS CiTY\nIS ESTIMATED AT 2:20\n-EST\nCST\nMST\nNEXT POINT OF INTEREST WE SHALL FLY OVER AT APPROXIMATELY 10: 49 PPOCLOCK ST\nIS_\nALBUQUERQUE, N.M.\nLEFT\nIT WILL BE ON OUR\nREMARKS.\nRIGHT\n(Signed) CAPTAIN-\nIf you wish to keep a Flight Record as a souvenir or mail it to a friend,\nplease ask your Hostess.\nI will gladly make a duplicate on request.",
